#!/usr/bin/env python3.11
"""agentctl — agent platform CLI.

MVP wires up the three foundation modules (telemetry 3.2, registry 3.4,
worktrees 3.5) into a single spawn entry point plus read/control commands.

Subcommands: spawn | list | status | logs | kill

Known follow-ups: --detach mode (double-fork daemon for overnight launchd),
per-agent tool scoping via the frontmatter `tools:` field, budget gate (3.7),
Slack hooks (3.8).
"""
