                                "default: reviewer + security-reviewer)")
    sp_rready.add_argument("--allow-unverified", dest="allow_unverified", action="store_true",
                           help="count a stamp that carries no run-id (the human-supervised "
                                "steward Agent-tool path); never admits a stamp whose run-id "
